  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Psy 100) #5675, eff 7-22-93; EXPIRED: 7-22-99 New. #7625, eff 1-10-02, EXPIRED: 1-10-10 New. #9854, eff 1-25-11; ss by #10857, eff 6-24-15; amd by #11076, eff 4-19-16; ss by #13786, eff 12-19-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mhp 300); amd by #14052, EXRF, eff 8-17-24; ss by #14464, eff 2-17-26, EXPIRES 2-17-36",
